T3 plan_revise (after retiring ids 0..4) allocates:
- id5: PAIR, depthlv 0, count 1, child 255, next 255,
  tokL 91, tokR 93, live 1 (inner, type of pat[1]).
- id6: NEST, depthlv 1, count 0, child 5, next 255,
